anchor anchorTargetHideOnScrollNavbar_qJOx" id="feed">Feed<a href="#feed" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Feed" title="Direct link to Feed" translate="no">​</a></h2>{"\n"}<p>You can generate RSS / Atom / JSON feed by passing <code>feedOptions</code>. By default, RSS and Atom feeds are generated. To disable feed generation, set <code>feedOptions.type</code> to <code>null</code>.</p>{"\n"}<div class="language-ts codeBlockContainer_jDV4 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color: #393A34; --prism-background-color: #f6f8fa;"><div class="codeBlockContent_cKMj"><pre tabindex="0" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250);" class="prism-code language-ts codeBlock_Gebt thin-scrollbar"><code class="codeBlockLines_FJaf"><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token keyword" style="color: rgb(207, 34, 46);">type</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token class-name" style="color: rgb(17, 99, 41);">FeedType</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token operator" style="color: rgb(215, 58, 73);">=</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color: rgb(198, 16, 95);">'rss'</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token operator" style="color: rgb(215, 58, 73);">|</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color: rgb(198, 16, 95);">'atom'</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token operator" style="color: rgb(215, 58, 73);">|</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color: rgb(198, 16, 95);">'json'</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">;</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain" style="display: inline-block;"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain"></span><span class="token keyword" style="c